flowchart TD
    start([Implement caller-supplied scoped feature]) --> plan[Derive tasks from its Definition and release Design]
%% @airflow-context plan
%% Caller supplies feature ID, new-work/rework mode and any findings. Keep that
%% target throughout this call; do not select a different feature. Use its approved Definition and the currently approved
%% release Design. Record the active feature/node and next action in `.air/index.md`;
%% create external tasks only when a tracker is configured and authorized.
%% @end-airflow-context
    plan --> implement[Implement the feature within the approved scope]
%% @airflow-context implement
%% Work autonomously on routine implementation decisions within approved scope.
%% Do not pause for routine coding choices. Pause for unclear/conflicting
%% requirements, blockers, scope changes or unauthorized side effects.
%% @end-airflow-context
    implement --> checks[Run focused checks and update `.air/index.md`]
    checks --> complete{Feature tasks complete and focused checks pass?}
    complete -- No: continue or fix --> implement
    complete -- Yes: return to caller --> implementationComplete([Feature implementation complete])
    complete -- Blocked or scope unclear: stop and report --> blocked([Blocked: ask user])

    classDef boundary fill:#126a52,color:#ffffff,stroke:#126a52
    class start,implementationComplete,blocked boundary
    classDef approval fill:#fff0e8,color:#633b2c,stroke:#c68162
    class complete approval
